amdgpu on an AMD Ryzen 3 4300U (Renoir APU, Radeon Vega 6, 1002:1636),
kernel 7.0, captured with Proccoli idle.

- sys/class/drm/card1/device: the amdgpu sysfs attributes Proccoli reads,
  its hwmon (power1 is "PPT": the whole APU package), and gpu_metrics
  (format v2.2, the same bytes as gpu_metrics-idle.bin).
- gpu_metrics-idle.bin / gpu_metrics-load.bin: idle, and after 3 s of a
  busy loop on all four cores (socket 34 W, FPPT throttling).
